    "content": "Kaip pakeisti esamojo įrašo naudotoją Šis straipsnis parodo, kaip pakeisti esamojo įrašo naudotoją.\nPasiekiama versijoje: 10.2 ir naujesnėse.\nTaikytina: Motion Catalyst ir Swing Catalyst.\nWhat version do I have?\nNote: Articles that have both Motion Catalyst and Swing Catalyst tagged means the article applies to both variants of the software, despite the slight visual difference.\nIn the event a recording has been made and saved to a different user than you wanted, it’s now possible to change this (from version 10.2 and newer).\nChanging the user on a recording In the screenshots below there is a recording stored under the wrong user called: “Wrong User”, it should be stored under my name, “Stian Eklund”, the screenshots \u0026 steps show how to change this.\nOpen a recording that you wish to change the user on.\nSelect the user name drop-down underneath the Explorer icon (top left).\nClick Edit.\nSelect the new user you wish to store the recording under.\n*If the user doesn’t exist you will need to create it first and then repeat steps 2 through 4.\nLast updated: 2023-12-15 | View on official support site",
